WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.550
Particles react only when they collide with at least the activation energy.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.400
Particles react only when they collide with enough energy, the activation energy.

3
00:00:13.114 --> 00:00:17.414
Hotter means faster particles, and more collisions with enough energy.

4
00:00:18.315 --> 00:00:23.365
So the reaction goes faster; concentration and catalysts change the rate too.
